  "description": "ResponsiveWebPSourceSet is an ASP.NET Core TagHelper that automatically converts JPEG, PNG and GIF images to WebP and generates responsive HTML picture, source and srcset elements.\n\n\t\t  Features:\n\n\t\t  • Automatic WebP conversion\n\t\t  • Responsive picture/source/srcset generation\n\t\t  • Multiple configurable media breakpoints\n\t\t  • Automatic width and height detection\n\t\t  • Lazy and eager loading support\n\t\t  • FetchPriority support (high, low, auto)\n\t\t  • SEO-friendly image markup\n\t\t  • Bootstrap img-fluid support\n\t\t  • Automatic responsive image optimization\n\t\t  • Improved Core Web Vitals and PageSpeed scores\n\t\t  • Reduced bandwidth usage\n\t\t  • Extremely fast and easy to use\n\n\t\t  Perfect for ASP.NET Core MVC, Razor Pages and Blazor applications.",
